    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.poster.avif?t=1750751236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.webm?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.mp4?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try on the role of a food delivery man from the small town N. You have to live in this small and melancholy town for a whole week, collecting and delivering food to different people who inhabit this town. Eavesdrop on scraps of conversations on the street, interact with characters and be a good delivery boy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The streets are filled with details and characters. Some of them have extra quests and stories just for you. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The melancholy atmosphere of the city. A reality filled with sadness and humor. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take pictures of the city and get achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.poster.avif?t=1750751236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.webm?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.mp4?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.poster.avif?t=1750751236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.webm?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/dc88989a2f0222a28a00b96ee07673ea.mp4?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try on the role of a food delivery man from the small town N. You have to live in this small and melancholy town for a whole week, collecting and delivering food to different people who inhabit this town. Eavesdrop on scraps of conversations on the street, interact with characters and be a good delivery boy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The streets are filled with details and characters. Some of them have extra quests and stories just for you. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The melancholy atmosphere of the city. A reality filled with sadness and humor. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take pictures of the city and get achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.poster.avif?t=1750751236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.webm?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496130/extras/bb11df2f6f2f3b4620ce69c447f30906.mp4?t=1750751236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hello, Your Order is a story-driven adventure game about a food deliveryman in a small town. You will have to live a week in his skin, collect orders, drive old buses, take atmospheric photos and soak up the melancholic atmosphere of your town and get to know its inhabitants.",
